 "segments": [
  {
   "text": "Is your run club the new Love Island?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.392
  },
  {
   "text": "Strava's 2024 Year in Sport survey found nearly one in five Gen Z respondents had dated someone they met through exercise. That's a global survey, about exercise overall.",
   "start": 3.088,
   "end": 15.453
  },
  {
   "text": "So we mapped 13 Sydney run clubs from public sources, and flagged the ones that meet outside the City of Sydney, like Bondi and Bronte.",
   "start": 15.964,
   "end": 24.149
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's how the data moves: public club pages into one sourced table,",
   "start": 24.753,
   "end": 29.432
  },
  {
   "text": "onto a map, into a short vertical reel.",
   "start": 29.641,
   "end": 32.555
  },
  {
   "text": "What we don't claim: no love-odds score, and no local Microburbs demographic finding, because API access was blocked from our build machine.",
   "start": 33.159,
   "end": 41.715
  },
  {
   "text": "Every figure has a source in the README. Thanks.",
   "start": 42.319,
   "end": 45.465
  }
 ]
